    description: "A freight claim pays only if it is filed in time and holds up. What a valid claim needs, the time limits under US law, and why small claims expire."
  - title: "Revenue Leakage in Logistics: Where It Hides and How to Find Yours"
    permalink: "https://runink.org/blog/logistics-revenue-leakage/"
    date: "2026-10-17T09:00:00Z"
    description: "Revenue leakage in logistics is money you were owed, or should never have paid, that nobody asked back. Where it sits, and how to measure yours in a month."
